      "id": "section-6-launchpad",
      "title": "Section 6 — Launchpad program",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Program ID: HtKnLjomtPrjJwyuQe6HApuEcnb76AUp3oG3nTpnQSAr\n\nThis is not pump.fun. The pump.fun program ID is 6EF8rrecthR5Dkzon8Nwu78hRvfCKubJ14M5uBEwF6P. The launchpad used here is a separate BPF upgradeable loader program that handled token creation, metadata, minting, mint revocation, and the initial buy in a single atomic transaction."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Solana Explorer: [View Program](https://explorer.solana.com/address/HtKnLjomtPrjJwyuQe6HApuEcnb76AUp3oG3nTpnQSAr)\nSolana FM: [View Program](https://solana.fm/address/HtKnLjomtPrjJwyuQe6HApuEcnb76AUp3oG3nTpnQSAr)"
        }
